  "details": "Began noticing effects having an issue in some worlds that in some cases disappear if I look away, they either are present immediately or take a minute or two to start happening. Using desktop/non-vr version, and updated graphics drivers hoping that'd fix the issue but it persists, maybe even slightly worse than before. 6750xt with Adrenalin 24.9.1 drivers and have decent temps, not quite sure what's happening but I imagine it'd be a pain for vr users to deal with. Edit: started the past week or two to my knowledge even before the halloween update.",
